OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FClear
OL,6,Fspells, with scattered showers
OL,7,Farriving from the north later in the
OL,8,Fnight. Feeling chilly inland, with a
OL,9,Fwidespread frost developing and a risk
OL,10,Fof ice on any untreated surfaces.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FA frosty start for many
OL,13,Fplaces, with a risk of ice on
OL,14,Funtreated surfaces. Showers continuing
OL,15,Fthrough the morning, gradually
OL,16,Fdissipating to leave prolonged sunny
OL,17,Fspells by the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
