OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FDry
OL,6,Fwith sunny spells, apart from isolated
OL,7,Fcoastal showers Sunday, and rain
OL,8,Farriving late on Monday. Overnight
OL,9,Ffrosts, with a risk of patchy freezing
OL,10,Fmist or fog. Generally rather cold.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
